The actual run completed on CPU because CUDA initialization was unavailable in this execution environment; the configuration and device are recorded rather than misreported. PatchTST did not beat the naive lag-1 baseline (validation MAE 2123.66 vs 215.43), so the evidence explicitly makes no superiority claim. The full repository suite is still running.
